:"Float ratio"}]},{"type":"p","text":"on leather properties."},{"type":"p","text":"The objective should be to improve:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Quality"},{"text":"Yield"},{"text":"Chemical efficiency"},{"text":"Process consistency"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Leather Defect Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a defect database containing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Scratches"},{"text":"Grain damage"},{"text":"Loose grain"},{"text":"Colour variation"},{"text":"Wrinkles"},{"text":"Uneven finishing"},{"text":"Thickness variation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Then perform root-cause analysis."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Sustainable Tanning"},{"type":"p","text":"Compare conventional tanning with lower-impact alternatives."},{"type":"p","text":"Evaluate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Chemical consumption"},{"text":"Water consumption"},{"text":"Waste generation"},{"text":"Energy consumption"},{"text":"Leather quality"},{"text":"Cost"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This is particularly valuable for future-oriented roles."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — AI-Based Leather Defect Detection"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop a computer-vision prototype that identifies surface defects using:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Python"},{"text":"OpenCV"},{"text":"Machine learning"},{"text":"Deep learning"},{"text":"Image classification"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Possible defects:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Scratches"},{"text":"Spots"},{"text":"Grain defects"},{"text":"Colour irregularities"},{"text":"Surface damage"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This combines Leather Technology + AI, creating a strong 2030+ skill profile."}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Industrial exposure is extremely important."},{"type":"h","text":"Tanneries"},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Leather processing units"},{"text":"Integrated tanneries"},{"text":"Export-oriented tanneries"},{"text":"Leather clusters"}]},